 Liu Y-T, Huang C-P, Zouboulis CC, Gallo RL, et al. (2008) Vaccination Targeting a Surface Sialidase of <italic>P. acnes</italic>: Implication for New Treatment of Acne Vulgaris. PLoS ONE 3(2): e1551. doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0001551 </p></body></article>